        <styleUrl>#intel</styleUrl>
        <description>The U.S. military is engaged in ongoing testing and development of new technologies, including advanced surface-to-air missile systems and drones. The country is also commemorating the 25th anniversary of the 9/11 attacks. The U.S. Air Force is considering a cost-effective drone successor for the MQ-9A, and China&#39;s largest stealth drone is confirmed with a unique wing configuration. The War Department has marked the 25th anniversary of 9/11, and there are ongoing discussions about DTS Processing and Approval Failure Messages.</description>
